From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Fallin <chris@cfallin.org>
Date: Thu, 19 Feb 2026 10:40:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PBL: add weval annotations

--enable-pbl-weval (ENABLE_JS_PBL_WEVAL): weval specialisation of the
portable baseline interpreter and its CacheIR stubs, with two jit-tests.

Source commits in YurtOS/firefox (yurt dff5cf534448):
  18566eacce39 PBL: add weval annotations
    (all included paths except third_party/weval)
---
 js/moz.configure                              |  15 +
 js/src/gc/GC.cpp                              |  10 +
 js/src/jit-test/tests/gc/bug-1791975.js       |   7 +
 js/src/jit-test/tests/strings/concat.js       |  15 +
 js/src/jit/BaselineCacheIRCompiler.cpp        |  13 +
 js/src/jit/CacheIR.cpp                        |   4 +
 js/src/jit/CacheIRCompiler.cpp                |  24 +
